Yes, it is.

> Checked slots_required() in weapon.c lately?

slots_required(skill)
int skill;
{
    int tmp = P_SKILL(skill);
    if (skill <= P_LAST_WEAPON || skill == P_TWO_WEAPON_COMBAT)
        return tmp;
    return (tmp + 1) / 2;
}

Since all spell skills are higher than P_LAST_WEAPON, their
requirements (like those of barehanded or riding) are halved rounded
up compared to the corresponding level of weapon or two-weapon
skills. A little testing in wizmode (which lists slots available in
the #enhance menu) will confirm this.

